  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/10/IMG_4745.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>La tarde de este viernes se ha abierto en el Casal Jove de Onda la II Feria de Asociaciones, que continuar&aacute; durante toda la jornada de este s&aacute;bado con <a href=\"http://onda.es/la-ciudad/eventos/ii-fira-d-associacions\" target=\"_blank\">un completo y variado programa de actividades</a>. La tarde del viernes en 72 fotos.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaassociacionscasaljove14divendres/img_4693.jpg\" alt=\"img_4693\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaassociacionscasaljove14divendres/img_4694.jpg\" alt=\"img_4694\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaassociacionscasaljove14divendres/img_4695.jpg\" alt=\"img_4695\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaassociacionscasaljove14divendres/img_4696.jpg\" alt=\"img_4696\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaassociacionscasaljove14divendres/img_4697.jpg\" alt=\"img_4697\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaassociacionscasaljove14divendres/img_4698.jpg\" alt=\"img_4698\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaassociacionscasaljove14divendres/img_4699.jpg\" alt=\"img_4699\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaassociacionscasaljove14divendres/img_4700.jpg\" alt=\"img_4700\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd